Permit2SenderPolicy::check1271SignedAction
├── given the sender is Permit2
│   └── it should return true
├── given the sender is the zero address
│   └── it should return false
├── given the sender is the account
│   └── it should return false
├── given any other sender
│   └── it should return false
└── given any configId, account, hash or signature
    └── it should depend on the sender only
